1 CONC ternal uncle)Louise Pittaluga (Born circa 1939; named after her materna
1 CONC l grandmother, Luigia)ðŸ¡ Innovation at Bella Vista Farm (Late 1940s–19
1 CONC 50s)The Country Estate: Seeking a more rural life for his children, Loui
1 CONC s used his masonry earnings to purchase a property in Montgomery County
1 CONC , Pennsylvania, known as "Bella Vista Farm", located in the Willow Grov
1 CONC e area (Upper Moreland Township).Life on the Farm: The 1950 U.S. Censu
1 CONC s shows the family completely settled on the farm. While Louis managed t
1 CONC he agricultural land, he continued to leverage his bricklaying skills fo
