1 CONC nical mind. While living on the farm, he designed a specialized structur
1 CONC al casting and filed a framework design with the government. On Decembe
1 CONC r 7, 1954, he was officially granted U.S. Patent No. 2,696,396 for a "Co
1 CONC rner Fitting for Swing Frames."ðŸŒ´ Retirement in Hollywood, Florida (19
1 CONC 60s–1981)The Move South: Local Willow Grove directories indicate the Pit
1 CONC talugas left Bella Vista Farm around 1957 or 1958 as their children reac
1 CONC hed adulthood. Seeking a warmer climate for retirement, Louis and Angeli
1 CONC na migrated south to Hollywood, Florida, a coastal city in Broward Count
1 CONC y.Civic Life: By the early 1960s, Louis and Angelina were fully establis
1 CONC hed Florida residents, consistently registering and voting as members o
1 CONC f the Democratic Party in Broward County's coastal precincts. During thi
1 CONC s era, they watched their sons build independent lives, including Joseph
